1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,096
Marking homework by hand takes teachers hours every week. And parents are often left guessing how their child is really doing.

2
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:16,596
Homework Studio fixes that. Here's how it works, step by step.

3
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:25,391
Step one: just snap a photo of the homework. A worksheet, or even a page from a book.

4
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:35,328
Step two: the A.I. reads every question and every handwritten answer, and tells you how confident it is about each one.

5
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:43,576
Step three: correct answers are scored instantly, so a whole class is graded in seconds.

6
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:56,399
Step four, and this is the important one. If it isn't sure it read an answer correctly, it never guesses the grade. It asks the teacher to confirm.

7
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:06,519
Step five: every week, a warm, plain-language progress report is written for each child, completely automatically.

8
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:13,831
It even flags students who are falling behind, so no one slips through the cracks.

9
00:01:15,333 --> 00:01:20,181
And when kids get stuck, a friendly tutor shows them the steps.

10
00:01:21,833 --> 00:01:32,273
Less marking for teachers. Real visibility for parents. Learning that kids enjoy. That's Homework Studio.
